# PART 6 — ATTRIBUTION & CAMPAIGN TRACKING

Implement a proper attribution layer.

The objective is to understand where visitors came from and which campaigns generate meaningful contact actions.

## 6.1 URL Parameters

Capture and preserve these parameters when present:

- utm_source
- utm_medium
- utm_campaign
- utm_content
- utm_term
- ttclid

Also capture:
- Initial landing URL.
- Referrer.
- Landing timestamp.
- Current page path.

Do not assume every visitor will have these parameters.

## 6.2 TikTok Click ID

Capture the `ttclid` query parameter from landing URLs.

Preserve it using an appropriate first-party attribution mechanism.

Do not lose it during:
- Internal navigation.
- CTA interactions.
- Page transitions.
- Website redirects.

Do not invent a ttclid if it does not exist.

## 6.3 Attribution Storage

Implement an attribution service.

Suggested file:

`src/utils/attribution.ts`

It should:

- Read the original URL query parameters.
- Extract TikTok click ID.
- Extract UTM parameters.
- Save the first-touch attribution.
- Preserve the latest-touch attribution separately.
- Make attribution information accessible to genuine lead flows.
- Avoid collecting unnecessary personal data.
- Respect applicable storage and cookie consent requirements.

Use session storage when persistence beyond the active session is unnecessary.

Use persistent first-party storage only with an appropriate consent mechanism and documented retention policy.

## 6.4 Attribution Parameters in Events

Include relevant page and attribution information in supported event payloads.

Use the officially supported TikTok event parameters.

Never send the business's own WhatsApp number as customer information.

Never include sensitive customer data in event properties.

## 6.5 WhatsApp Attribution Limitations

Important:

A browser-side WhatsApp link click can be measured.

However, a normal external WhatsApp deep link cannot confirm that the visitor sent the message or that the business received a qualified lead.

Do not claim that a WhatsApp click equals a confirmed conversation.

For actual lead-level attribution, document the possibility of integrating WhatsApp Business Platform or a CRM webhook in a future phase.

